instanceMethods.comment:
Returns a 2D curve to which the qualifier is assigned. Warning The returned curve is an adapted curve, i.e. an object which is an interface between:
- the services provided by a 2D curve from the package Geom2d,
- and those required on the curve by a computation algorithm. The Geom2d curve on which the adapted curve is based can be obtained in the following way: myQualifiedCurve = ... ; {@link Geom2dAdaptor_Curve | `Geom2dAdaptor_Curve`} myAdaptedCurve = myQualifiedCurve.Qualified(); `occ::handle<Geom2d_Curve>` = myAdaptedCurve.Curve();
